  },
  "slides": {
    "slide_0": {
      "group": "Verse 1",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Jesus, I my cross have taken, all to leave and follow Thee.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "All things else I have forsaken, Thou from hence my all shall be.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Perish every fond ambition, all I've sought or hoped or known.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Yet how rich is my condition! God and Heaven are still mine own.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_1": {
      "group": "Verse 2",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Let the world despise and leave me, they have left my Savior, too.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Human hearts and looks deceive me; Thou art faithful, Thou art true.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "O, 'tis not in grief to harm me, while thy love is left to me;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "O, 'twere not in joy to charm me, If that love be hid from me.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_2": {
      "group": "Verse 3",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Soul, then know thy full salvation; rise o'er sin, and fear, and care;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Joy to find in every station something still to do or bear:",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Think what Spirit dwells within thee; Think what Father's smiles are thine;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Think that Jesus died to win thee, child of heaven, canst thou repine?",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_3": {
      "group": "Verse 4",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Haste then on from grace to glory, armed by faith, and winged by prayer,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Heaven's eternal day's before thee, God's own hand shall guide thee there.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Soon shall close thy earthly mission, soon shall pass thy pilgrim days;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Hope soon change to glad fruition, faith to sight, and prayer to praise.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
